---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Data Deletion Instructions | Restoration AI"
  description="How to remove Restoration AI's access to your accounts and request deletion of your data."
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-24 max-w-4xl">
    <div class="bg-[#020617] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-full blur-[80px] -z-10"></div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Data Deletion Instructions</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 mb-10">Restoration AI LLC &middot; Last updated September 30, 2026</p>
      <div class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
        <p>You can ask Restoration AI to delete the data we hold about you or your business at any time, including any data we received from Facebook or Instagram.</p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-3">Remove our access to Facebook or Instagram</h2>
        <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>On Facebook, go to <strong>Settings &amp; privacy &rarr; Settings &rarr; Business integrations</strong> (or Apps and websites).</li>
          <li>Find <strong>Restoration AI</strong> and select <strong>Remove</strong>.</li>
          <li>For Instagram, go to <strong>Settings &rarr; Website permissions &rarr; Apps and websites</strong> and remove Restoration AI.</li>
        </ol>
        <p>Removing access stops all new data collection immediately.</p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-3">Request deletion of stored data</h2>
        <p>Email <a href="mailto:contact@restorationai.io?subject=Data%20deletion%20request" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline">contact@restorationai.io</a> with the subject "Data deletion request" and the business name or Facebook Page involved. We confirm receipt within 2 business days and complete deletion within 30 days, then email you a confirmation. Data we must keep for legal or billing reasons is kept only as long as required.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-400 mt-8">Restoration AI LLC &middot; 7465 Bella Vista Road, Atascadero, CA 93422 &middot; contact@restorationai.io</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
